#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Every Smarter platform runs an MCP server that answers questions about The "
"Smarter Project from its own source code and documentation."
msgstr ""
"Chaque plateforme Smarter exécute un serveur MCP qui répond aux questions "
"sur The Smarter Project à partir de son propre code source et de sa "
"documentation."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the MCP server"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur le serveur MCP"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has SDKs for Python, Node.js and Go, a command-line interface "
"written in Go, and a VS Code extension for its YAML manifests."
msgstr ""
"Smarter propose des SDK pour Python, Node.js et Go, une interface en ligne "
"de commande écrite en Go et une extension VS Code pour ses manifestes YAML."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See the APIs and SDKs"
msgstr "Voir les API et les SDK"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The Smarter Project was inspired by the Kubernetes Project, which is open "
"source software for declarative cloud infrastructure management."
msgstr ""
"The Smarter Project s'est inspiré du projet Kubernetes, un logiciel open "
"source de gestion déclarative de l'infrastructure cloud."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about manifests"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur les manifestes"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's manifests are programmed with Pydantic, the popular open source "
"Python data validation library on PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Les manifestes de Smarter sont programmés avec Pydantic, la populaire "
"bibliothèque open source Python de validation de données, disponible sur "
"PyPI."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read why Smarter uses Pydantic"
msgstr "Lire pourquoi Smarter utilise Pydantic"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's repository has Agent Skills: instructions that teach AI coding "
"agents its conventions, from its tests to its translations."
msgstr ""
"Le dépôt de Smarter contient des Agent Skills : des instructions qui "
"enseignent ses conventions aux agents de programmation IA, de ses tests à "
"ses traductions."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Browse the skills"
msgstr "Parcourir les skills"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter was first used in a classroom in January 2026, by AI students at the "
"University of British Columbia."
msgstr ""
"Smarter a été utilisé pour la première fois en classe en janvier 2026, par "
"des étudiants en IA de l'University of British Columbia."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the Instructor Guide"
msgstr "Lire le guide de l'instructeur"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has a Free Course Catalog of ready-to-teach courses, from prompt "
"engineering for non-programmers to Kubernetes for platform engineers."
msgstr ""
"Smarter propose un catalogue de cours gratuits prêts à enseigner, de "
"l'ingénierie de prompts pour les non-programmeurs à Kubernetes pour les "
"ingénieurs plateforme."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The chat in the Prompt Engineer's Workbench is its own open source npm "
"package, @smarter.sh/ui-chat, which you can embed in any website."
msgstr ""
"Le chat du Prompt Engineer's Workbench est un paquet npm open source à part "
"entière, @smarter.sh/ui-chat, que vous pouvez intégrer à n'importe quel site "
"web."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See it on npm"
msgstr "Le voir sur npm"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Claude Code translated Smarter's web console into Spanish, French and "
"Brazilian Portuguese in a single day, October 16, 2026."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code a traduit la console web de Smarter en espagnol, en français et "
"en portugais du Brésil en une seule journée, le 16 octobre 2026."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the translations"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur les traductions"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's ImageSearchPlugin was written by Claude Code during a live, in-"
"class demonstration for AI students at the University of British Columbia. "
"It went into production the following day."
msgstr ""
"L'ImageSearchPlugin de Smarter a été écrit par Claude Code lors d'une "
"démonstration en direct, en classe, pour des étudiants en IA de l'University "
"of British Columbia. Il est passé en production le lendemain."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the ImageSearchPlugin"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur l'ImageSearchPlugin"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The web console speaks English, Spanish, French and Brazilian Portuguese. "
"You can choose a language from the user menu."
msgstr ""
"La console web parle anglais, espagnol, français et portugais du Brésil. "
"Vous pouvez choisir une langue dans le menu utilisateur."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat has a WordPress plugin, a Drupal module and a Shopify app "
"block, which put a deployed LLMClient on your site."
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat a une extension WordPress, un module Drupal et un bloc "
"d'application Shopify, qui placent un LLMClient déployé sur votre site."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about Smarter Chat"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur Smarter Chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's manifests can be edited not only in the web console, but also in "
"code editors such as VS Code."
msgstr ""
"Les manifestes de Smarter peuvent être modifiés non seulement dans la "
"console web, mais aussi dans des éditeurs de code comme VS Code."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the VS Code extension"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur l'extension VS Code"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's VS Code extension checks your YAML manifests as you type, "
"completes their keys and values, and fixes common mistakes."
msgstr ""
"L'extension VS Code de Smarter vérifie vos manifestes YAML pendant que vous "
"tapez, complète leurs clés et leurs valeurs, et corrige les erreurs "
"courantes."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's command-line interface works much like kubectl and runs on "
"Windows, macOS and Linux. Like the aws cli, you set it up with one command: "
"smarter configure."
msgstr ""
"L'interface en ligne de commande de Smarter fonctionne un peu comme kubectl "
"et s'exécute sur Windows, macOS et Linux. Comme l'aws cli, elle se configure "
"avec une seule commande : smarter configure."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the command-line interface"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur l'interface en ligne de commande"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"On a Mac, you can install the smarter command-line interface with Homebrew."
msgstr ""
"Sur un Mac, vous pouvez installer l'interface en ligne de commande smarter "
"avec Homebrew."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Every Smarter platform publishes an OpenAPI document of its REST API, which "
"SDKs and AI agents can read."
msgstr ""
"Chaque plateforme Smarter publie un document OpenAPI de son API REST, que "
"les SDK et les agents IA peuvent lire."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the OpenAPI document"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur le document OpenAPI"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's server log messages are designed to help AI agents diagnose run-"
"time errors: each one starts with the dotted path of the code that wrote it, "
"so it reads like a stack trace."
msgstr ""
"Les messages de journal du serveur de Smarter sont conçus pour aider les "
"agents IA à diagnostiquer les erreurs d'exécution : chacun commence par le "
"chemin pointé du code qui l'a écrit, et se lit donc comme une stack trace."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the logging style guide"
msgstr "Lire le guide de style de la journalisation"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has more than 50 Waffle switches that turn optional features and "
"logging on and off, including whether these Did you know? notes appear."
msgstr ""
"Smarter a plus de 50 interrupteurs Waffle qui activent et désactivent des "
"fonctions optionnelles et la journalisation, y compris l'affichage de ces "
"notes Le saviez-vous ?."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the Waffle switches"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur les interrupteurs Waffle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors invented their own object caching system, the "
"@cache_results() decorator, which builds each cache key from the arguments "
"of the function that it caches."
msgstr ""
"Les auteurs de Smarter ont inventé leur propre système de cache d'objets, le "
"décorateur @cache_results(), qui construit chaque clé de cache à partir des "
"arguments de la fonction qu'il met en cache."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about @cache_results()"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur @cache_results()"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors created their own Django base model, "
"MetaDataWithOwnershipModel, which gives each AI resource its name, "
"description, version, tags and owner."
msgstr ""
"Les auteurs de Smarter ont créé leur propre modèle de base Django, "
"MetaDataWithOwnershipModel, qui donne à chaque ressource d'IA son nom, sa "
"description, sa version, ses étiquettes et son propriétaire."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read its source code"
msgstr "Lire son code source"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's version numbers and changelogs are generated from its commit "
"messages, by semantic-release."
msgstr ""
"Les numéros de version et les journaux des modifications de Smarter sont "
"générés à partir de ses messages de commit, par semantic-release."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See the releases"
msgstr "Voir les versions"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors designed their own Django-React integration: Vite builds "
"each page's React app, and a Django template tag mounts it."
msgstr ""
"Les auteurs de Smarter ont conçu leur propre intégration Django-React : Vite "
"compile l'application React de chaque page, et une balise de gabarit Django "
"la monte."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the React integration"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur l'intégration React"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Most pages of this web console are small React apps that Django hosts, and "
"every one of their Storybook stories also runs as a unit test."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des pages de cette console web sont de petites applications React "
"hébergées par Django, et chacune de leurs stories Storybook s'exécute aussi "
"comme test unitaire."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter is an open source project, and anyone can contribute to it, "
"including you."
msgstr ""
"Smarter est un projet open source, et tout le monde peut y contribuer, y "
"compris vous."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read how to contribute"
msgstr "Lire comment contribuer"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The Get Weather LLMClient's tool is a Smarter Extension written in Python. "
"Beginning Python programmers can write extensions too."
msgstr ""
"L'outil du LLMClient Get Weather est une Smarter Extension écrite en Python. "
"Les débutants en Python peuvent aussi écrire des extensions."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the extension developer guide"
msgstr "Lire le guide du développeur d'extensions"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter Extensions, such as weather, calculator and date-calculator, are "
"published in a public registry on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Les Smarter Extensions, comme weather, calculator et date-calculator, sont "
"publiées dans un registre public sur GitHub."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Browse the extensions registry"
msgstr "Parcourir le registre des extensions"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's Python docstrings are published, by Sphinx, as the technical "
"reference of its documentation."
msgstr ""
"Les docstrings Python de Smarter sont publiées, par Sphinx, comme référence "
"technique de sa documentation."

