#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/App.tsx
msgid "Collapse all"
msgstr "Tout réduire"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/App.tsx
msgid "Fetch the tree again, after a manifest was changed"
msgstr "Récupérer à nouveau l'arbre, après la modification d'un manifeste"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/App.tsx
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Recharger"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/App.tsx
msgid ""
"A locked card is a resource that you can't read, such as another account's."
msgstr ""
"Une carte verrouillée est une ressource que vous ne pouvez pas lire, comme "
"celle d'un autre compte."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/App.tsx
msgid "Who owns a resource, and who may read it"
msgstr "Qui possède une ressource, et qui peut la lire"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Open this LLMClient's manifest"
msgstr "Ouvrez le manifeste de ce LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Click Copy on the example, and paste it into the manifest."
msgstr "Cliquez sur Copier dans l'exemple, puis collez-le dans le manifeste."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Click Save. Smarter applies the manifest at once. Then reload this tab, and "
"the new resource appears in the tree."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur Enregistrer. Smarter applique aussitôt le manifeste. Rechargez "
"ensuite cet onglet : la nouvelle ressource apparaît dans l'arbre."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Choose it"
msgstr "Choisissez cette option"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Paste it at the start of a new line beneath %(spec)s. If the manifest "
"already has the same key with an empty list, such as %(empty)s, replace that "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Collez-le au début d'une nouvelle ligne sous %(spec)s. Si le manifeste "
"contient déjà la même clé avec une liste vide, comme %(empty)s, remplacez "
"cette ligne."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Prochaines étapes"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Make this LLMClient your own"
msgstr "Personnalisez ce LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Most LLMClients have Guardrails, tools, a look of their own and an api key. "
"This one is missing some of them. Each takes a few lines of YAML: copy an "
"example below into the manifest, and save it."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des LLMClients ont des garde-fous, des outils, une apparence qui "
"leur est propre et une clé d'API. Il en manque à celui-ci. Chacun ne demande "
"que quelques lignes de YAML : copiez un exemple ci-dessous dans le "
"manifeste, puis enregistrez-le."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add your first Guardrail"
msgstr "Ajoutez votre premier garde-fou"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A Guardrail screens the text that passes between the user and the LLM. An "
"input Guardrail checks each prompt before it is sent to the LLM, and an "
"output Guardrail checks each response before the user sees it. When it finds "
"what it looks for, such as an email address, a prompt injection or a leaked "
"password, it blocks the message, redacts what it found, or logs it."
msgstr ""
"Un garde-fou filtre le texte qui passe entre l'utilisateur et le LLM. Un "
"garde-fou d'entrée vérifie chaque prompt avant son envoi au LLM, et un garde-"
"fou de sortie vérifie chaque réponse avant que l'utilisateur ne la voie. "
"Lorsqu'il trouve ce qu'il cherche, comme une adresse e-mail, une injection "
"de prompt ou un mot de passe divulgué, il bloque le message, masque ce qu'il "
"a trouvé ou le journalise."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Guardrails are ordinary software, not the LLM's judgment, so they enforce "
"your rules however the LLM behaves. Smarter comes with built-in Guardrails "
"for the most common cases, which every LLMClient may use by name: personal "
"data, secrets, prompt injection, moderation, off-topic prompts and more."
msgstr ""
"Les garde-fous sont du logiciel ordinaire, et non le jugement du LLM : ils "
"appliquent donc vos règles quel que soit le comportement du LLM. Smarter "
"fournit des garde-fous intégrés pour les cas les plus courants, que tout "
"LLMClient peut utiliser par leur nom : données personnelles, secrets, "
"injection de prompt, modération, prompts hors sujet, et plus encore."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the Guardrails"
msgstr "Parcourir les garde-fous"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Built-in Guardrails"
msgstr "Garde-fous intégrés"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Two built-in Guardrails"
msgstr "Deux garde-fous intégrés"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"%(pii)s removes credit card numbers, email addresses and phone numbers from "
"each prompt, and %(injection)s blocks prompts that try to override the "
"LLMClient's instructions. Neither calls an LLM."
msgstr ""
"%(pii)s retire de chaque prompt les numéros de carte bancaire, les adresses "
"e-mail et les numéros de téléphone, et %(injection)s bloque les prompts qui "
"tentent de contourner les instructions du LLMClient. Aucun des deux "
"n'appelle de LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add your first tool"
msgstr "Ajoutez votre premier outil"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLM knows only what it was trained on and what is in its prompt. Tools "
"give it everything else: today's weather, a row in your database, a "
"calculation that it would otherwise guess at. Smarter offers the LLM the "
"tools that the LLMClient lists, the LLM decides when to call one, and "
"Smarter runs it and hands back the result."
msgstr ""
"Un LLM ne connaît que ce sur quoi il a été entraîné et ce que contient son "
"prompt. Les outils lui donnent tout le reste : la météo du jour, une ligne "
"de votre base de données, un calcul qu'il devinerait autrement. Smarter "
"propose au LLM les outils que le LLMClient liste, le LLM décide quand en "
"appeler un, et Smarter l'exécute et lui renvoie le résultat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"There are three ways to add tools, which differ in who writes them and where "
"they run. An LLMClient may use all three at once."
msgstr ""
"Il existe trois façons d'ajouter des outils, qui diffèrent par qui les écrit "
"et où ils s'exécutent. Un LLMClient peut utiliser les trois à la fois."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugins"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A plugin is a manifest that configures one of Smarter's built-in tool "
"patterns: answer from static data, run a SQL query, call a REST api, follow "
"a skill, search the web, or search for images. Nothing is coded or "
"installed, and it runs on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Un plugin est un manifeste qui configure l'un des modèles d'outils intégrés "
"de Smarter : répondre à partir de données statiques, exécuter une requête "
"SQL, appeler une api REST, suivre une skill, chercher sur le web ou chercher "
"des images. Rien n'est codé ni installé, et il s'exécute sur Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "for your own data, databases and apis, without writing code."
msgstr ""
"pour vos propres données, bases de données et api, sans écrire de code."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A sample static plugin about a fictional candy, which needs no Connection or "
"Secret. Then ask the LLMClient about the Everlasting Gobstopper."
msgstr ""
"Un exemple de plugin statique sur un bonbon imaginaire, qui ne demande ni "
"connexion ni secret. Interrogez ensuite le LLMClient sur l'Everlasting "
"Gobstopper."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the plugins"
msgstr "Parcourir les plugins"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An Extension is Python code, packaged and published to the Smarter Extension "
"registry, that a platform administrator installs, much as a WordPress "
"administrator installs a plugin. Its tools do whatever Python can do, and "
"they run on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Une extension est du code Python, empaqueté et publié dans le registre des "
"extensions Smarter, qu'un administrateur de la plateforme installe, comme un "
"administrateur WordPress installe un plugin. Ses outils font tout ce que "
"Python sait faire, et ils s'exécutent sur Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"when a tool needs real code, or for a ready-made tool that is already "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"quand un outil demande du vrai code, ou pour un outil prêt à l'emploi déjà "
"installé."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An official Extension, which does arithmetic exactly. The Extensions page "
"lists those that are installed on this platform."
msgstr ""
"Une extension officielle, qui fait des calculs arithmétiques exacts. La page "
"Extensions liste celles qui sont installées sur cette plateforme."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the Extensions"
msgstr "Parcourir les extensions"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An MCPClient is a manifest that connects to a remote MCP server: a third "
"party's tools, published with the Model Context Protocol. Smarter offers the "
"server's tools to the LLM and calls them on that server. Nothing is coded, "
"and nothing runs on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Un MCPClient est un manifeste qui se connecte à un serveur MCP distant : les "
"outils d'un tiers, publiés avec le Model Context Protocol. Smarter propose "
"les outils du serveur au LLM et les appelle sur ce serveur. Rien n'est codé, "
"et rien ne s'exécute sur Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"for a service that already publishes an MCP server, such as GitHub, Notion "
"or Stripe."
msgstr ""
"pour un service qui publie déjà un serveur MCP, comme GitHub, Notion ou "
"Stripe."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An example MCPClient for DeepWiki, which documents public GitHub "
"repositories, and requires no authentication."
msgstr ""
"Un exemple de MCPClient pour DeepWiki, qui documente les dépôts GitHub "
"publics, et ne demande aucune authentification."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the MCPClients"
msgstr "Parcourir les MCPClients"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Plugins, Extensions and MCP servers compared"
msgstr "Plugins, extensions et serveurs MCP comparés"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Extensibility"
msgstr "Extensibilité"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Style its chat"
msgstr "Personnalisez le style de son chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient's chat has Smarter's default look. A few lines of styles give "
"it yours: your logo in the header, your colors on the message bubbles, your "
"font, a picture behind the conversation. They apply in the workbench and on "
"every web page that embeds the chat. You don't need to know CSS, and every "
"setting is optional."
msgstr ""
"Le chat de ce LLMClient a l'apparence par défaut de Smarter. Quelques lignes "
"de styles lui donnent la vôtre : votre logo dans l'en-tête, vos couleurs sur "
"les bulles des messages, votre police, une image derrière la conversation. "
"Ils s'appliquent dans le workbench et sur chaque page web qui intègre le "
"chat. Inutile de connaître CSS, et chaque réglage est facultatif."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Styles go in %(styles)s, beside %(prompt)s: paste it at the start of the "
"line after the last line of %(prompt)s, with the same indent as %(prompt)s."
msgstr ""
"Les styles se placent dans %(styles)s, à côté de %(prompt)s : collez-le au "
"début de la ligne qui suit la dernière ligne de %(prompt)s, avec la même "
"indentation que %(prompt)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Styling your LLMClient's chat"
msgstr "Styles du chat de votre LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "The chat's styles"
msgstr "Les styles du chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter's logo, the Inter font, a dark header, and the user's messages in "
"orange. Swap in your own logo's url and colors."
msgstr ""
"Le logo de Smarter, la police Inter, un en-tête sombre et les messages de "
"l'utilisateur en orange. Remplacez l'url du logo et les couleurs par les "
"vôtres."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add an api key"
msgstr "Ajoutez une clé d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Without an api key, this LLMClient is public once it is deployed: anyone who "
"has its url can chat with it, and every prompt is charged to its owner. "
"Attach an api key, and its url requires it: each request must send the key "
"in an %(header)s header, and Smarter refuses those that don't. The workbench "
"doesn't need the key, because you are signed in."
msgstr ""
"Sans clé d'API, ce LLMClient est public une fois déployé : toute personne "
"qui a son url peut discuter avec lui, et chaque prompt est facturé à son "
"propriétaire. Attachez une clé d'API, et son url l'exige : chaque requête "
"doit envoyer la clé dans un en-tête %(header)s, et Smarter refuse celles qui "
"ne le font pas. L'atelier n'a pas besoin de la clé, car vous êtes connecté."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"The quickest way is this workbench's Deployment tab, which creates an api "
"key, shows its secret once, and attaches it, in one step. To attach a key "
"that you already have, name it in the manifest. An LLMClient has one api "
"key, and only an account admin can create one."
msgstr ""
"Le plus rapide est l'onglet Déploiement de cet atelier, qui crée une clé "
"d'API, affiche son secret une seule fois et l'attache, en une seule étape. "
"Pour attacher une clé que vous avez déjà, indiquez son nom dans le "
"manifeste. Un LLMClient a une seule clé d'API, et seul un administrateur du "
"compte peut en créer une."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Paste it at the start of a new line beneath %(spec)s. If the manifest "
"already has an %(apiKey)s line, replace that line."
msgstr ""
"Collez-le au début d'une nouvelle ligne sous %(spec)s. Si le manifeste a "
"déjà une ligne %(apiKey)s, remplacez cette ligne."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse your api keys"
msgstr "Parcourez vos clés d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "API Keys"
msgstr "Clés d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "The LLMClient's api key"
msgstr "La clé d'API du LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Change %(name)s to the name of one of your own api keys, as the API Keys "
"page lists them."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez %(name)s par le nom de l'une de vos propres clés d'API, tel que la "
"page Clés d'API l'affiche."

#. Translators: the tab of the Console that draws the tree of resources that the LLMClient is built from.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx, react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "How this LLMClient is built"
msgstr "Comment ce LLMClient est construit"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLMClient is a sophisticated solution, built artisanally from a "
"hierarchical tree of SAM resources. This is its tree: each card is a "
"resource that it uses, directly or through another resource."
msgstr ""
"Un LLMClient est une solution sophistiquée, construite de façon artisanale à "
"partir d'un arbre hiérarchique de ressources SAM. Voici son arbre : chaque "
"carte est une ressource qu'il utilise, directement ou par l'intermédiaire "
"d'une autre ressource."

#. Translators: SAM is the Smarter Application Manifest, a product name.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Everything is a SAM resource"
msgstr "Tout est une ressource SAM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Smarter Application Manifests"
msgstr "Smarter Application Manifests"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"LLMClients, Providers, plugins, Connections, Secrets and Guardrails are all "
"SAM resources. Each is declared in a manifest, a short YAML document that "
"says what the resource should be, and Smarter makes it so."
msgstr ""
"Les LLMClients, fournisseurs, plugins, connexions, secrets et guardrails "
"sont tous des ressources SAM. Chacun est déclaré dans un manifeste, un court "
"document YAML qui dit ce que la ressource doit être, et Smarter s'en charge."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Edit any manifest here"
msgstr "Modifiez n'importe quel manifeste ici"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "The web console"
msgstr "La console web"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"Every manifest can be edited directly in the web console. Click a card to "
"open its resource's manifest in a new tab, change it, and save it: Smarter "
"applies it at once."
msgstr ""
"Chaque manifeste peut être modifié directement dans la console web. Cliquez "
"sur une carte pour ouvrir le manifeste de sa ressource dans un nouvel "
"onglet, modifiez-le et enregistrez-le : Smarter l'applique aussitôt."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "An LLMClient is a tree"
msgstr "Un LLMClient est un arbre"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx, react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "LLMClients"
msgstr "LLMClients"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Dependency trees"
msgstr "Arbres de dépendances"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"Its Provider supplies the LLM, its plugins and MCPClients give it tools, its "
"Guardrails screen what goes in and out, and the Connections and Secrets "
"beneath them reach your data, safely. A resource that two others use appears "
"under each of them."
msgstr ""
"Son fournisseur apporte le LLM, ses plugins et MCPClients lui donnent des "
"outils, ses guardrails filtrent ce qui entre et sort, et les connexions et "
"secrets en dessous atteignent vos données, en toute sécurité. Une ressource "
"utilisée par deux autres apparaît sous chacune d'elles."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ManifestSnippet.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx, react/packages/smarter-serverlogs/src/components/ServerLogs.tsx
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copié"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ManifestSnippet.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copier"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceCard.tsx
msgid "About %(kind)s, in the documentation"
msgstr "À propos de %(kind)s, dans la documentation"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceCard.tsx
msgid "You can't read this resource"
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas lire cette ressource"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceCard.tsx
msgid "Open the manifest of %(name)s in a new tab"
msgstr "Ouvrir le manifeste de %(name)s dans un nouvel onglet"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceTree.tsx
msgid "Hide what %(name)s uses"
msgstr "Masquer ce qu'utilise %(name)s"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceTree.tsx
msgid "Show what %(name)s uses"
msgstr "Afficher ce qu'utilise %(name)s"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceTree.tsx
msgid "%(count)s more"
msgid_plural "%(count)s more"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s de plus"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s de plus"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ResourceTree.tsx
msgid "The resources that this LLMClient is built from"
msgstr "Les ressources dont ce LLMClient est construit"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "A tool that the LLM can call"
msgstr "Un outil que le LLM peut appeler"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "A chat with an LLM, its tools, and its rules"
msgstr "Un chat avec un LLM, ses outils et ses règles"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "The LLM provider whose models it prompts"
msgstr "Le fournisseur de LLM dont il interroge les modèles"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "The tools of a remote MCP server"
msgstr "Les outils d'un serveur MCP distant"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Tools installed from an extension package"
msgstr "Des outils installés depuis un paquet d'extension"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Screens prompts and responses"
msgstr "Filtre les prompts et les réponses"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "How a plugin reaches a remote api"
msgstr "Comment un plugin atteint une api distante"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "How a plugin reaches a database"
msgstr "Comment un plugin atteint une base de données"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "An encrypted credential"
msgstr "Un identifiant chiffré"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "The api key that its url requires"
msgstr "La clé d'api que son url exige"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "The domain that it is served from"
msgstr "Le domaine depuis lequel il est servi"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Compute that hosts an LLM"
msgstr "Du calcul qui héberge un LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Coordinates several LLMClients"
msgstr "Coordonne plusieurs LLMClients"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Forwards requests to an LLM provider"
msgstr "Transmet les requêtes à un fournisseur de LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Documents, indexed for search"
msgstr "Des documents, indexés pour la recherche"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Searches a vector store"
msgstr "Cherche dans un magasin de vecteurs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "Limits what it may spend"
msgstr "Limite ce qu'il peut dépenser"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/lib/kinds.ts
msgid "A SAM resource"
msgstr "Une ressource SAM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "No api key is attached: the url is public."
msgstr "Aucune clé d'API n'est attachée : l'url est publique."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Every request to the url needs %(name)s."
msgstr "Chaque requête à l'url a besoin de %(name)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"%(name)s is attached, but turned off, so the url is public. Turn it on in "
"API Keys, or attach another key."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s est attachée, mais désactivée, donc l'url est publique. Activez-la "
"dans Clés d'API, ou attachez une autre clé."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Detach"
msgstr "Détacher"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "snake_case: the name that the manifest's spec.apiKey uses."
msgstr "snake_case : le nom qu'utilise spec.apiKey dans le manifeste."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "The chat on www.example.com"
msgstr "Le chat sur www.example.com"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Attach it to this LLMClient"
msgstr "L'attacher à ce LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Create the api key"
msgstr "Créer la clé d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Choose its api key"
msgstr "Choisissez sa clé d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Copy its secret now"
msgstr "Copiez son secret maintenant"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"This is the secret of %(name)s. Smarter keeps only a hash of it, and can't "
"show it again: store it somewhere safe, such as a password manager or your "
"hosting's secrets. It is what your front end sends, in place of %"
"(placeholder)s."
msgstr ""
"Voici le secret de %(name)s. Smarter n'en garde qu'un hachage et ne peut pas "
"l'afficher de nouveau : conservez-le en lieu sûr, par exemple dans un "
"gestionnaire de mots de passe ou les secrets de votre hébergement. C'est ce "
"qu'envoie votre front end, à la place de %(placeholder)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Your account's api keys"
msgstr "Les clés d'API de votre compte"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Last used"
msgstr "Dernière utilisation"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Jamais"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attached"
msgstr "Attachée"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attach"
msgstr "Attacher"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "There are no api keys that you can manage yet."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas encore de clé d'API que vous pouvez gérer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/lib/messages.ts
msgid ""
"Only the LLMClient's owner, or an account admin, can change its api key."
msgstr ""
"Seul le propriétaire du LLMClient, ou un administrateur du compte, peut "
"changer sa clé d'API."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Create an api key"
msgstr "Créez une clé d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is yours. Its secret is shown once, right after you create it. The "
"web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"La clé est à vous. Son secret n'est affiché qu'une fois, juste après sa "
"création. La page Clés d'API de la console web liste vos clés, et désactive "
"une clé sans la supprimer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"Only an account admin can create api keys. Ask one to create a key for you, "
"then attach it here, or ask them to run:"
msgstr ""
"Seul un administrateur du compte peut créer des clés d'API. Demandez-lui de "
"créer une clé pour vous, puis attachez-la ici, ou demandez-lui d'exécuter :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Conversations"
msgstr "Conversations"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Chat sessions"
msgstr "Sessions de chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Every conversation with %(app_name)s is a chat session, which the platform "
"identifies by a session key. The session's messages are stored on the "
"platform, so a conversation survives a page reload, or a visit to another "
"page: the chat sends its key, and the platform answers with the conversation "
"so far."
msgstr ""
"Chaque conversation avec %(app_name)s est une session de chat, que la "
"plateforme identifie par une clé de session. Les messages de la session sont "
"conservés sur la plateforme, si bien qu'une conversation survit au "
"rechargement de la page, ou à la visite d'une autre page : le chat envoie sa "
"clé, et la plateforme répond avec la conversation jusque-là."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The platform makes it"
msgstr "La plateforme la crée"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The first %(config)s request of a chat that has no key gets a new one, 64 "
"hexadecimal characters, in the response's %(field)s. Don't make up your own: "
"the platform checks its format."
msgstr ""
"La première requête %(config)s d'un chat qui n'a pas de clé en reçoit une "
"nouvelle, de 64 caractères hexadécimaux, dans le champ %(field)s de la "
"réponse. N'inventez pas la vôtre : la plateforme vérifie son format."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The client keeps it"
msgstr "Le client la conserve"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is all that the client stores: the browser, or your own server. The "
"session's messages, and the platform's records of its tool calls and costs, "
"stay on the platform."
msgstr ""
"La clé est tout ce que le client conserve : le navigateur, ou votre propre "
"serveur. Les messages de la session, et les enregistrements de la plateforme "
"sur ses appels d'outils et ses coûts, restent sur la plateforme."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Forgetting it starts over"
msgstr "L'oublier recommence à zéro"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"A %(config)s request without a key starts a new session, with a new key. "
"That is all that Smarter Chat's New chat button does."
msgstr ""
"Une requête %(config)s sans clé démarre une nouvelle session, avec une "
"nouvelle clé. C'est tout ce que fait le bouton de nouveau chat de Smarter "
"Chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Smarter Chat does it for you"
msgstr "Smarter Chat s'en occupe pour vous"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat keeps the key in a cookie, %(cookie)s by default, for one day, "
"and for the page's path, so that each page has its own conversation. Set %"
"(cookie_path)s to %(root)s to keep one conversation as the visitor moves "
"from page to page. The embed script keeps its own cookie, for the whole site."
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat conserve la clé dans un cookie, %(cookie)s par défaut, pendant "
"un jour, et pour le chemin de la page, si bien que chaque page a sa propre "
"conversation. Réglez %(cookie_path)s sur %(root)s pour garder une seule "
"conversation pendant que le visiteur passe d'une page à l'autre. Le script "
"d'intégration conserve son propre cookie, pour tout le site."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The WordPress, Drupal and Shopify integrations, and the html snippet, use "
"Smarter Chat, so they need nothing more."
msgstr ""
"Les intégrations WordPress, Drupal et Shopify, et l'extrait html, utilisent "
"Smarter Chat, elles n'ont donc besoin de rien d'autre."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "In your own front end"
msgstr "Dans votre propre front end"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Start a session"
msgstr "Démarrez une session"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Send %(config)s with no key, as the first command in How this url works "
"does. Its response's %(field)s is the new session's key."
msgstr ""
"Envoyez %(config)s sans clé, comme le fait la première commande de Comment "
"fonctionne cette url. Le champ %(field)s de sa réponse est la clé de la "
"nouvelle session."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep the key"
msgstr "Conservez la clé"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"In the browser, in localStorage or a cookie. In a server-to-server "
"integration, in your own database, beside your user, so that each of your "
"users has their own conversation."
msgstr ""
"Dans le navigateur, dans localStorage ou un cookie. Dans une intégration de "
"serveur à serveur, dans votre propre base de données, à côté de votre "
"utilisateur, pour que chacun de vos utilisateurs ait sa propre conversation."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Send it with every prompt"
msgstr "Envoyez-la avec chaque prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Add it to the body, as %(field)s. The request still carries the whole "
"conversation, in %(messages)s, and the platform adds the new messages to the "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez-la au corps, en tant que %(field)s. La requête contient toujours "
"toute la conversation, dans %(messages)s, et la plateforme ajoute les "
"nouveaux messages à la session."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Come back to it"
msgstr "Revenez-y"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"After a reload, send %(config)s with the key. Its response's %(history)s is "
"the conversation so far, to display again, and its %(field)s is the same key."
msgstr ""
"Après un rechargement, envoyez %(config)s avec la clé. Le champ %(history)s "
"de sa réponse est la conversation jusque-là, à afficher de nouveau, et son %"
"(field)s est la même clé."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep a session key private"
msgstr "Gardez la clé de session privée"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has a session key, and can call this url, can read its "
"conversation, with the %(config)s request above. Don't put it in a url that "
"people share, in a log, or in an analytics event. It doesn't authenticate "
"the caller: an api key does that."
msgstr ""
"Quiconque possède une clé de session, et peut appeler cette url, peut lire "
"sa conversation, avec la requête %(config)s ci-dessus. Ne la mettez pas dans "
"une url que l'on partage, dans un journal ou dans un événement d'analyse. "
"Elle n'authentifie pas l'appelant : c'est le rôle d'une clé d'API."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-vectorstore-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "Deployed"
msgstr "Déployé"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughRequest/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderSelector/Component.tsx
msgid "LLM provider"
msgstr "Fournisseur de LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/ListView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughResponse/ResponseSummary.tsx
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Modèle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Access"
msgstr "Accès"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Api key required"
msgstr "Clé d'API requise"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Publique"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient"
msgstr "Ce LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Every request needs one of this LLMClient's api keys. A key that is in a web "
"page is public: give each site a key of its own, and revoke it if it is "
"abused."
msgstr ""
"Chaque requête a besoin de l'une des clés d'API de ce LLMClient. Une clé qui "
"figure dans une page web est publique : donnez à chaque site sa propre clé, "
"et révoquez-la en cas d'abus."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is charged to its "
"owner. Attach an api key to require one, or give it a budget."
msgstr ""
"Toute personne qui a cette url peut discuter avec lui, et chaque prompt est "
"facturé à son propriétaire. Attachez une clé d'API pour l'exiger, ou donnez-"
"lui un budget."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Need to secure this url?"
msgstr "Besoin de sécuriser cette url ?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Live"
msgstr "En ligne"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Not deployed yet"
msgstr "Pas encore déployé"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s is live. Its system prompt, its LLM and its tools now answer at "
"its own url:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s est en ligne. Son prompt système, son LLM et ses outils "
"répondent désormais à sa propre url :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s works here, in the workbench, but nobody else can reach it yet. "
"Deploy it, and it gets its own url, with its own TLS certificate:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s fonctionne ici, dans l'atelier, mais personne d'autre ne peut "
"encore y accéder. Déployez-le, et il aura sa propre url, avec son propre "
"certificat TLS :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"This url is an api, not a web page. It is the backend of Smarter Chat, the "
"chat window of the workbench, which is also the %(package)s npm package. Put "
"Smarter Chat on a web page, point it at this url, and your visitors are "
"talking to %(app_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Cette url est une api, pas une page web. C'est le backend de Smarter Chat, "
"la fenêtre de chat de l'atelier, qui est aussi le paquet npm %(package)s. "
"Placez Smarter Chat sur une page web, pointez-le vers cette url, et vos "
"visiteurs parlent à %(app_name)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Deploy it with the smarter cli:"
msgstr "Déployez-le avec le cli smarter :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter then creates its host and its TLS certificate, which can take a few "
"minutes. Reopen this tab afterwards. Until then, here is what you'll be able "
"to do with it."
msgstr ""
"Smarter crée alors son hôte et son certificat TLS, ce qui peut prendre "
"quelques minutes. Rouvrez cet onglet ensuite. En attendant, voici ce que "
"vous pourrez en faire."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Back to the workbench"
msgstr "Retour à l'atelier"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Where to go from here?"
msgstr "Et maintenant ?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "How this url works"
msgstr "Comment fonctionne cette url"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "Sous le capot"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends this url two kinds of requests, and so can your own code. "
"Both are POST requests, with JSON in and JSON out. Copy a command into a "
"terminal to try it."
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat envoie deux types de requêtes à cette url, et votre propre code "
"le peut aussi. Ce sont deux requêtes POST, avec du JSON en entrée et du JSON "
"en sortie. Copiez une commande dans un terminal pour l'essayer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient requires a Smarter api key: replace <YOUR-API-KEY> with yours."
msgstr ""
"Ce LLMClient exige une clé d'API Smarter : remplacez <YOUR-API-KEY> par la "
"vôtre."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "starts a chat"
msgstr "démarre un chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the LLMClient's configuration, such as its name, welcome message, "
"example prompts and colors, and a session_key for the new chat."
msgstr ""
"Elle renvoie la configuration du LLMClient, comme son nom, son message "
"d'accueil, ses exemples de prompts et ses couleurs, et un session_key pour "
"le nouveau chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "sends a prompt"
msgstr "envoie un prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the messages that the prompt added to the chat. Send the "
"session_key with every prompt, and Smarter keeps the chat's history."
msgstr ""
"Elle renvoie les messages que le prompt a ajoutés au chat. Envoyez le "
"session_key avec chaque prompt, et Smarter conserve l'historique du chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Answers are Markdown"
msgstr "Les réponses sont en Markdown"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The response is JSON, and the assistant's message in it is Markdown. Smarter "
"Chat renders it, with code highlighting, math and diagrams. In your own "
"front end, use any Markdown library."
msgstr ""
"La réponse est du JSON, et le message de l'assistant qu'elle contient est en "
"Markdown. Smarter Chat l'affiche, avec la coloration du code, les "
"mathématiques et les diagrammes. Dans votre propre front end, utilisez "
"n'importe quelle bibliothèque Markdown."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Secrets stay on the server"
msgstr "Les secrets restent sur le serveur"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter calls the LLM and runs the tools. Their api keys and credentials "
"never reach the browser."
msgstr ""
"Smarter appelle le LLM et exécute les outils. Leurs clés d'API et leurs "
"identifiants n'atteignent jamais le navigateur."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat's configuration, and a new chat session, whose session_key "
"continues the chat in later prompts."
msgstr ""
"La configuration du chat, et une nouvelle session de chat, dont le "
"session_key poursuit le chat dans les prompts suivants."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Sends the LLMClient's first example prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr ""
"Envoie le premier exemple de prompt du LLMClient, et renvoie la réponse du "
"LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Sends a prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr "Envoie un prompt, et renvoie la réponse du LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "The response, abbreviated:"
msgstr "La réponse, abrégée :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Things to ask it"
msgstr "Ce que vous pouvez lui demander"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "How it was built"
msgstr "Comment il a été construit"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Designed in the workbench. Declared in YAML."
msgstr "Conçu dans l'atelier. Déclaré en YAML."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s was designed, tested and debugged in the Prompt Engineer's "
"Workbench of the Smarter web console, and is deployed from a manifest: a "
"short YAML file that declares everything it is. Change the manifest, apply "
"it, and the url answers with your changes."
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s a été conçu, testé et débogué dans l'atelier de l'ingénieur de "
"prompts de la console web Smarter, et il est déployé à partir d'un "
"manifeste : un court fichier YAML qui déclare tout ce qu'il est. Modifiez le "
"manifeste, appliquez-le, et l'url répond avec vos modifications."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Declarative: the manifest says what the LLMClient is, and Smarter makes it "
"so."
msgstr ""
"Déclaratif : le manifeste dit ce qu'est le LLMClient, et Smarter le réalise."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Version controlled: keep manifests in git, review them in pull requests, "
"apply them from CI."
msgstr ""
"Versionné : gardez les manifestes dans git, relisez-les dans des pull "
"requests, appliquez-les depuis la CI."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Two commands from a YAML file to a live api with its own host and TLS "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Deux commandes pour passer d'un fichier YAML à une api en ligne avec son "
"propre hôte et son certificat TLS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Open it in the workbench"
msgstr "L'ouvrir dans l'atelier"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "LLMClient docs"
msgstr "Documentation de LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient's manifest, as smarter describe llmclient returns it, without "
"its owner's username. Its status is what Smarter reports about it, and is "
"read-only."
msgstr ""
"Le manifeste de ce LLMClient, tel que le renvoie smarter describe llmclient, "
"sans le nom d'utilisateur de son propriétaire. Son status est ce que Smarter "
"en rapporte, et il est en lecture seule."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient isn't yours"
msgstr "Ce LLMClient n'est pas à vous"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(name)s belongs to %(owner)s, who shares it with you. You can chat with it, "
"read its manifest and use everything on this page that only reads it, but "
"only its owner, or an admin of its account, can change it, deploy it or "
"attach an api key to it. That leaves you two choices."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s appartient à %(owner)s, qui le partage avec vous. Vous pouvez "
"discuter avec lui, lire son manifeste et utiliser tout ce qui, sur cette "
"page, ne fait que le lire, mais seul son propriétaire, ou un administrateur "
"de son compte, peut le modifier, le déployer ou lui associer une clé d'api. "
"Il vous reste donc deux choix."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "1. Leave it as it is"
msgstr "1. Le laisser tel quel"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Use it as an example. Chat with it, read its manifest, and borrow whatever "
"you like for LLMClients of your own. Nothing that you do here changes it."
msgstr ""
"Servez-vous-en comme exemple. Discutez avec lui, lisez son manifeste et "
"reprenez ce qui vous plaît pour vos propres LLMClients. Rien de ce que vous "
"faites ici ne le modifie."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "2. Clone it, and work on your copy"
msgstr "2. Le cloner, et travailler sur votre copie"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A clone is a new LLMClient, owned by you, that starts as an exact copy of "
"this one: the same instructions, LLM provider and model, and the same "
"plugins, MCP clients and guardrails, except any that you aren't allowed to "
"use. It has its own name, and its own url. From then on the two are "
"independent: your changes to the copy never touch the original, and later "
"changes to the original never reach your copy."
msgstr ""
"Un clone est un nouveau LLMClient, qui vous appartient, et qui commence "
"comme une copie exacte de celui-ci : les mêmes instructions, le même "
"fournisseur et le même modèle de LLM, et les mêmes plugins, clients MCP et "
"guardrails, sauf ceux que vous n'avez pas le droit d'utiliser. Il a son "
"propre nom et sa propre url. Dès lors, les deux sont indépendants : vos "
"modifications de la copie ne touchent jamais l'original, et les "
"modifications ultérieures de l'original n'atteignent jamais votre copie."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Open the %(list)s list, and its %(tab)s tab."
msgstr "Ouvrez la liste des %(list)s, et son onglet %(tab)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Shared LLM Clients"
msgstr "Clients LLM partagés"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Find %(name)s, and click its %(clone)s button, the green icon of two pages."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez %(name)s, et cliquez sur son bouton %(clone)s, l'icône verte de deux "
"pages."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Clone"
msgstr "Cloner"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Type a name for your copy, and click %(ok)s. Smarter writes the name in "
"snake case: %(example)s becomes %(snake_case)s."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez un nom pour votre copie, et cliquez sur %(ok)s. Smarter écrit le "
"nom en snake case : %(example)s devient %(snake_case)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Your copy appears in the %(your_tab)s tab, under its new name, and the "
"original stays in %(shared_tab)s, unchanged. Open your copy in the "
"workbench, and from there edit its manifest, deploy it, and put it on your "
"site, as this page describes."
msgstr ""
"Votre copie apparaît dans l'onglet %(your_tab)s, sous son nouveau nom, et "
"l'original reste dans %(shared_tab)s, inchangé. Ouvrez votre copie dans le "
"workbench, et, de là, modifiez son manifeste, déployez-la et mettez-la sur "
"votre site, comme le décrit cette page."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Your LLM Clients"
msgstr "Vos clients LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "How ownership of Smarter resources works"
msgstr "Comment fonctionne la propriété des ressources Smarter"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "who owns a resource, who can read it, and who can change it."
msgstr "qui possède une ressource, qui peut la lire, et qui peut la modifier."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Your next step"
msgstr "Votre prochaine étape"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Put %(app_name)s in front of people. Smarter Chat works on any web site, and "
"these integrations are ready to use: pick the one that matches yours. Each "
"of them needs only this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"Mettez %(app_name)s devant le public. Smarter Chat fonctionne sur n'importe "
"quel site web, et ces intégrations sont prêtes à l'emploi : choisissez celle "
"qui correspond au vôtre. Chacune n'a besoin que de l'url de ce LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "First, allow your site's origin"
msgstr "D'abord, autorisez l'origine de votre site"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Browsers let a page call this url only if the LLMClient's manifest lists the "
"page's origin: its scheme, host and port, without a path. Add your site, and "
"your development server if you have one, then apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. Skip this, and the chat "
"fails in the browser with a CORS error."
msgstr ""
"Les navigateurs ne laissent une page appeler cette url que si le manifeste "
"du LLMClient déclare l'origine de la page : son schéma, son hôte et son "
"port, sans chemin. Ajoutez votre site, et votre serveur de développement si "
"vous en avez un, puis appliquez de nouveau le manifeste, dans l'onglet "
"Manifeste de l'atelier ou avec %(command)s. Sans cela, le chat échoue dans "
"le navigateur avec une erreur CORS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A plugin: a chat launcher on every page, a Smarter Chat block, and a "
"[smarter_chat] shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Une extension : un lanceur de chat sur chaque page, un bloc Smarter Chat et "
"un shortcode [smarter_chat]."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Download smarter-chat-<version>.zip from the plugin's latest release, and "
"upload it in Plugins, Add New, Upload Plugin."
msgstr ""
"Téléchargez smarter-chat-<version>.zip depuis la dernière version de "
"l'extension, puis téléversez-le dans Extensions, Ajouter, Téléverser une "
"extension."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "In Settings, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's url."
msgstr "Dans Réglages, Smarter Chat, saisissez l'url de ce LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Guide"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A module for Drupal 10.3 and 11: a chat launcher on every page, and a "
"Smarter Chat block for any region."
msgstr ""
"Un module pour Drupal 10.3 et 11 : un lanceur de chat sur chaque page, et un "
"bloc Smarter Chat pour n'importe quelle région."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Then, in Configuration, Web services, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's "
"url."
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, dans Configuration, Services web, Smarter Chat, saisissez l'url de "
"ce LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A theme app extension: a chat launcher on every page, and a Smarter Chat "
"block for any section."
msgstr ""
"Une extension d'app de thème : un lanceur de chat sur chaque page, et un "
"bloc Smarter Chat pour n'importe quelle section."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Deploy the extension as your store's own app, from a Shopify Partner "
"account, and install it on your store."
msgstr ""
"Déployez l'extension comme l'app de votre boutique, depuis un compte Shopify "
"Partner, puis installez-la sur votre boutique."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"In the theme editor, turn on App embeds, Smarter Chat launcher, and enter "
"this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"Dans l'éditeur de thème, activez Intégrations d'app, Smarter Chat launcher, "
"et saisissez l'url de ce LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Allow both of your store's origins: its myshopify.com domain, and its own "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Autorisez les deux origines de votre boutique : son domaine myshopify.com et "
"son propre domaine."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "React, from npm"
msgstr "React, depuis npm"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(package)s, the component that the workbench uses, for a React 19 "
"application built with Vite, webpack or Next.js."
msgstr ""
"%(package)s, le composant qu'utilise l'atelier, pour une application React "
"19 construite avec Vite, webpack ou Next.js."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Any web page, in html"
msgstr "N'importe quelle page web, en html"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"One script tag, with no build: for a static site, a server-rendered page, "
"Squarespace, Wix or Webflow. Paste it before </body>, and a chat button "
"appears in a corner of the page."
msgstr ""
"Une balise script, sans build : pour un site statique, une page rendue côté "
"serveur, Squarespace, Wix ou Webflow. Collez-la avant </body>, et un bouton "
"de chat apparaît dans un coin de la page."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat renders in its own Shadow DOM, so your site's css can't break it. "
"To put it inside the page instead of a launcher, add %(element)s where it "
"goes."
msgstr ""
"Le chat s'affiche dans son propre Shadow DOM, donc le css de votre site ne "
"peut pas le casser. Pour le placer dans la page plutôt qu'un lanceur, "
"ajoutez %(element)s à l'endroit voulu."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Something else?"
msgstr "Autre chose ?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager, and documentation sites built with Docusaurus, MkDocs, "
"Sphinx or VitePress, have integrations too. Or build your own front end on "
"this url's api, below, or with the Python, Node.js and Go SDKs."
msgstr ""
"Google Tag Manager, et les sites de documentation construits avec "
"Docusaurus, MkDocs, Sphinx ou VitePress, ont aussi des intégrations. Ou "
"construisez votre propre front end sur l'api de cette url, ci-dessous, ou "
"avec les SDK Python, Node.js et Go."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Docs sites"
msgstr "Sites de documentation"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "SDKs"
msgstr "SDK"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Give it to Smarter Chat"
msgstr "Donnez-la à Smarter Chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends the key with every request, as %(header)s. The WordPress, "
"Drupal and Shopify integrations have an api key setting. In html, add %"
"(attribute)s:"
msgstr ""
"Smarter Chat envoie la clé avec chaque requête, sous la forme %(header)s. "
"Les intégrations WordPress, Drupal et Shopify ont un réglage pour la clé "
"d'API. En html, ajoutez %(attribute)s :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"In React, pass apiKey, from your build's environment rather than from your "
"source code:"
msgstr ""
"En React, passez apiKey, depuis l'environnement de votre build plutôt que "
"depuis votre code source :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"An api key belongs to a staff user of your account, and a platform "
"administrator creates it with this command. The command prints the key's "
"name, and its secret, once: store the secret somewhere safe, such as a "
"password manager or your hosting's secrets."
msgstr ""
"Une clé d'API appartient à un utilisateur staff de votre compte, et un "
"administrateur de la plateforme la crée avec cette commande. La commande "
"affiche le nom de la clé et son secret, une seule fois : conservez le secret "
"en lieu sûr, par exemple dans un gestionnaire de mots de passe ou les "
"secrets de votre hébergement."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"The web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"La page Clés d'API de la console web liste vos clés, et désactive une clé "
"sans la supprimer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Name the key in the LLMClient's manifest, and apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. From then on, every "
"request to the url needs the key, and this page says \"Api key required\"."
msgstr ""
"Nommez la clé dans le manifeste du LLMClient, puis appliquez de nouveau le "
"manifeste, dans l'onglet Manifeste de l'atelier ou avec %(command)s. Dès "
"lors, chaque requête à l'url a besoin de la clé, et cette page indique « Clé "
"d'API requise »."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"To replace a key, create a new one, name it in the manifest instead, and "
"apply it: Smarter detaches the old key. Then turn the old key off."
msgstr ""
"Pour remplacer une clé, créez-en une nouvelle, nommez-la dans le manifeste à "
"la place, et appliquez-le : Smarter détache l'ancienne clé. Puis désactivez "
"l'ancienne clé."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Api keys"
msgstr "Clés d'API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient already requires an api key: the url answers only requests "
"that carry one of its keys. Here is how to give a key to a front end in "
"production, and how to replace one."
msgstr ""
"Ce LLMClient exige déjà une clé d'API : l'url ne répond qu'aux requêtes qui "
"portent l'une de ses clés. Voici comment donner une clé à un front end en "
"production, et comment la remplacer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Right now, anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is "
"charged to its owner. Attach an api key, and the url answers only requests "
"that carry it. The workbench keeps working, with your login."
msgstr ""
"Pour l'instant, toute personne qui a cette url peut discuter avec lui, et "
"chaque prompt est facturé à son propriétaire. Attachez une clé d'API, et "
"l'url ne répond qu'aux requêtes qui la portent. L'atelier continue de "
"fonctionner, avec votre connexion."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "You can do it right here."
msgstr "Vous pouvez le faire ici même."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "A key in a web page is not a secret"
msgstr "Une clé dans une page web n'est pas un secret"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who opens the page can read the key in its source, and use it from "
"anywhere. On a public site, a key limits who can call the url, rather than "
"hiding it, so combine it with the rest:"
msgstr ""
"Toute personne qui ouvre la page peut lire la clé dans sa source, et "
"l'utiliser depuis n'importe où. Sur un site public, une clé limite qui peut "
"appeler l'url, plutôt que de la cacher : combinez-la donc avec le reste :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give each site a key of its own, and turn it off if it is abused;"
msgstr "donnez à chaque site sa propre clé, et désactivez-la en cas d'abus ;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"list only your site's origins in allowedOrigins, which browsers enforce;"
msgstr ""
"ne déclarez que les origines de votre site dans allowedOrigins, que les "
"navigateurs font respecter ;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give the LLMClient a budget, which caps what its prompts can cost."
msgstr ""
"donnez un budget au LLMClient, qui plafonne ce que ses prompts peuvent "
"coûter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"For an internal tool, or a server-to-server integration, keep the key on "
"your server, and call this url from there."
msgstr ""
"Pour un outil interne, ou une intégration de serveur à serveur, gardez la "
"clé sur votre serveur, et appelez cette url depuis celui-ci."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "The Smarter Project"
msgstr "The Smarter Project"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Build your own LLM applications"
msgstr "Construisez vos propres applications LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Prompt Engineer's Workbench"
msgstr "Atelier de l'ingénieur de prompts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"Write the system prompt, chat with the LLM, and watch every request, tool "
"call and response as it happens."
msgstr ""
"Écrivez le prompt système, discutez avec le LLM, et observez chaque requête, "
"appel d'outil et réponse en direct."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Declarative manifests"
msgstr "Manifestes déclaratifs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"Every resource, from LLMClients to secrets, is a YAML manifest that you "
"apply with the cli or the api."
msgstr ""
"Chaque ressource, des LLMClients aux secrets, est un manifeste YAML que vous "
"appliquez avec le cli ou l'api."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
