msgstr "Renommer : renommer cette ressource de base vectorielle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-vectorstore-list/src/components/Toolbar/Component.tsx
msgid ""
"Delete: You can't delete this vectorstore, because other resources depend on "
"it, or you don't have permission to delete it"
msgstr ""
"Supprimer : vous ne pouvez pas supprimer cette base vectorielle, car "
"d'autres ressources en dépendent ou vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de la "
"supprimer"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-vectorstore-list/src/components/Toolbar/Component.tsx
