#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid "Chatbots, agents and harnesses, ready to run and customize."
msgstr "Chatbots, agents et harnesses, prêts à exécuter et à personnaliser."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid ""
"Guides, manifests, the command-line interface and the API, at "
"docs.smarter.sh."
msgstr ""
"Guides, manifestes, l'interface en ligne de commande et l'API, sur "
"docs.smarter.sh."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid "Visit the Smarter project"
msgstr "Visitez le projet Smarter"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid ""
"The open source project, its source code and its community, at smarter.sh."
