#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Welcome to Smarter, %(firstName)s!"
msgstr "Bienvenue sur Smarter, %(firstName)s !"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Welcome to Smarter!"
msgstr "Bienvenue sur Smarter !"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter is a platform for designing and running the kinds of sophisticated "
"AI solutions that large organizations require. It is made for non-"
"programmers."
msgstr ""
"Smarter est une plateforme pour concevoir et exécuter le genre de solutions "
"d'IA sophistiquées dont les grandes organisations ont besoin. Elle est faite "
"pour les non-programmeurs."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Free and open source"
msgstr "Libre et open source"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Licensed under the GNU AGPL v3. Download it, read its source code, and run "
"it on your laptop."
msgstr ""
"Sous licence GNU AGPL v3. Téléchargez-le, lisez son code source et exécutez-"
"le sur votre ordinateur portable."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Made for learning"
msgstr "Conçu pour apprendre"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "A hands-on place to learn how real AI solutions are designed and built."
msgstr ""
"Un lieu pratique pour apprendre comment de vraies solutions d'IA sont "
"conçues et construites."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "No code required"
msgstr "Aucun code requis"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every resource is a short YAML manifest that you can read, copy and change."
msgstr ""
"Chaque ressource est un court manifeste YAML que vous pouvez lire, copier et "
"modifier."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Your account is ready to explore"
msgstr "Votre compte est prêt à être exploré"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Your new account is preloaded with dozens of AI resources and solutions. "
"Open any of them to see how it works, then customize it and make it your own."
msgstr ""
"Votre nouveau compte est préchargé avec des dizaines de ressources et de "
"solutions d'IA. Ouvrez-en une pour voir comment elle fonctionne, puis "
"personnalisez-la et appropriez-la-vous."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Chatbots, agents and harnesses, each with its own LLM, system prompt and "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"Chatbots, agents et harnesses, chacun avec son propre LLM, son prompt "
"système et ses outils."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "LLM Tools"
msgstr "Outils LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Tool calling that connects an LLM to SQL databases, REST APIs, web search "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Des appels d'outils qui connectent un LLM à des bases de données SQL, des "
"API REST, la recherche web et plus encore."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Guardrails, secrets, API keys and budgets"
msgstr "Garde-fous, secrets, clés d'API et budgets"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"The controls that organizations need to run AI safely and affordably, such "
"as API keys that secure your LLMClients."
msgstr ""
"Les contrôles dont les organisations ont besoin pour exécuter l'IA de "
"manière sûre et abordable, comme les clés d'API qui sécurisent vos "
"LLMClients."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Get hands-on with the real thing"
msgstr "Mettez la main à la pâte avec du concret"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter supports popular generative AI technologies, vendors, protocols and "
"best practices. It's a good place to try them out and learn how they work."
msgstr ""
"Smarter prend en charge les technologies, fournisseurs, protocoles et bonnes "
"pratiques populaires de l'IA générative. C'est un bon endroit pour les "
"essayer et apprendre comment ils fonctionnent."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Thousands of LLMs from nine providers"
msgstr "Des milliers de LLM de neuf fournisseurs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Anthropic, Cohere, Fireworks AI, Google AI, Hugging Face, Meta AI, Mistral, "
"OpenAI and Together AI, side by side."
msgstr ""
"Anthropic, Cohere, Fireworks AI, Google AI, Hugging Face, Meta AI, Mistral, "
"OpenAI et Together AI, côte à côte."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "MCP, Agent Skills and tool calling"
msgstr "MCP, Agent Skills et appels d'outils"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Connect LLMs to tools and data with the protocols that the industry uses."
msgstr ""
"Connectez des LLM à des outils et à des données avec les protocoles "
"qu'utilise l'industrie."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real prompts, real costs"
msgstr "Vrais prompts, vrais coûts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every prompt is a real, billable request to an LLM provider. Experiment "
"freely, but please don't run automated loads."
msgstr ""
"Chaque prompt est une vraie requête facturable à un fournisseur de LLM. "
"Expérimentez librement, mais n'exécutez pas de charge automatisée, s'il vous "
"plaît."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Connect MCP Servers"
msgstr "Connectez des serveurs MCP"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"MCP Servers give your LLMClients the tools of other services, through the "
"Model Context Protocol. Connect one, and its tools are ready for your "
"LLMClients to use, with no code to write."
msgstr ""
"Les serveurs MCP donnent à vos LLMClients les outils d'autres services, "
"grâce au Model Context Protocol. Connectez-en un, et ses outils sont prêts à "
"être utilisés par vos LLMClients, sans écrire de code."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Dozens ready to connect"
msgstr "Des dizaines prêts à connecter"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "GitHub, Hugging Face, Notion, Linear, Sentry, Stripe and many more."
msgstr "GitHub, Hugging Face, Notion, Linear, Sentry, Stripe et bien d'autres."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Your credentials stay secret"
msgstr "Vos identifiants restent secrets"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A server's access token is kept in an encrypted Smarter Secret, and you "
"choose which of its tools the LLM may call."
msgstr ""
"Le jeton d'accès d'un serveur est conservé dans un Secret Smarter chiffré, "
"et vous choisissez lesquels de ses outils le LLM peut appeler."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Governed like everything else"
msgstr "Gouvernés comme tout le reste"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every tool call is logged and charged, and is subject to the same access "
"controls as your other resources."
msgstr ""
"Chaque appel d'outil est journalisé et facturé, et il est soumis aux mêmes "
"contrôles d'accès que vos autres ressources."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Answer from your own documents"
msgstr "Répondez à partir de vos propres documents"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) lets an LLM answer from your own "
"material, such as manuals, policies and support articles, rather than from "
"its training data alone."
msgstr ""
"La génération augmentée par récupération (RAG) permet à un LLM de répondre à "
"partir de vos propres documents, comme des manuels, des politiques et des "
"articles d'assistance, plutôt qu'à partir de ses seules données "
"d'entraînement."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Vector databases, Qdrant or Pinecone, that Smarter creates and manages for "
"you. Add PDFs, text, web pages and more, and Smarter splits, embeds and "
"loads them."
msgstr ""
"Des bases de données vectorielles, Qdrant ou Pinecone, que Smarter crée et "
"gère pour vous. Ajoutez des PDF, du texte, des pages web et plus encore, et "
"Smarter les découpe, calcule leurs embeddings et les charge."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Search by meaning"
msgstr "Recherche par le sens"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A question finds the passages that are closest to it in meaning, not just "
"those that share its words, and the LLM answers from them."
msgstr ""
"Une question trouve les passages les plus proches d'elle par le sens, pas "
"seulement ceux qui partagent ses mots, et le LLM répond à partir d'eux."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real databases, real costs"
msgstr "Vraies bases de données, vrais coûts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A Vectorstore runs on real cloud infrastructure, which costs real money for "
"as long as it exists, whether or not anyone searches it."
msgstr ""
"Un Vectorstore s'exécute sur une véritable infrastructure cloud, qui coûte "
"de l'argent réel tant qu'il existe, que quelqu'un l'interroge ou non."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Host open models yourself"
msgstr "Hébergez vous-même des modèles ouverts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"LLMHosts run open-weight models on your own GPU servers, rather than calling "
"a provider's API. Your LLMClients use them just as they use a commercial "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Les LLMHosts exécutent des modèles à poids ouverts sur vos propres serveurs "
"GPU, au lieu d'appeler l'API d'un fournisseur. Vos LLMClients les utilisent "
"comme ils utilisent un modèle commercial."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Models from Hugging Face"
msgstr "Des modèles de Hugging Face"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Choose a model and a revision, and Smarter deploys it on Kubernetes with an "
"inference engine such as vLLM."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un modèle et une révision, et Smarter le déploie sur Kubernetes "
"avec un moteur d'inférence comme vLLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "You choose the hardware"
msgstr "Vous choisissez le matériel"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Pick the kind of GPU node that the model runs on, and how much of it each "
"replica gets."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez le type de nœud GPU sur lequel le modèle s'exécute, et la part "
"qu'en reçoit chaque réplique."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real servers, real costs"
msgstr "Vrais serveurs, vrais coûts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLMHost runs on real cloud infrastructure, which costs real money for as "
"long as it runs, whether or not anyone sends it a prompt."
msgstr ""
"Un LLMHost s'exécute sur une véritable infrastructure cloud, qui coûte de "
"l'argent réel tant qu'elle fonctionne, que quelqu'un lui envoie un prompt ou "
"non."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Built for production, at scale"
msgstr "Conçu pour la production, à grande échelle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter runs AI solutions in production on Kubernetes, the same cloud "
"orchestration technology behind global platforms such as Netflix, YouTube "
"and TikTok."
msgstr ""
"Smarter exécute des solutions d'IA en production sur Kubernetes, la même "
"technologie d'orchestration cloud qui fait tourner des plateformes mondiales "
"comme Netflix, YouTube et TikTok."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "State-of-the-art orchestration"
msgstr "Une orchestration de pointe"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Kubernetes grew out of Borg, the system that runs Google's services, YouTube "
"among them. Netflix and ByteDance, TikTok's parent, run their platforms on "
"it too."
msgstr ""
"Kubernetes est issu de Borg, le système qui fait tourner les services de "
"Google, dont YouTube. Netflix et ByteDance, la maison mère de TikTok, y font "
"aussi tourner leurs plateformes."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Grows with demand"
msgstr "Suit la demande"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter's web servers and workers run as several copies, Kubernetes replaces "
"any that fail, and the cluster adds servers when they need more room."
msgstr ""
"Les serveurs web et les workers de Smarter tournent en plusieurs copies, "
"Kubernetes remplace celles qui échouent, et le cluster ajoute des serveurs "
"quand elles ont besoin de plus de place."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Every LLMClient at its own url"
msgstr "Chaque LLMClient à sa propre url"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Deploying an LLMClient gives it its own host name, with a TLS certificate "
"that the cluster issues and renews by itself."
msgstr ""
"Déployer un LLMClient lui donne son propre nom d'hôte, avec un certificat "
"TLS que le cluster émet et renouvelle de lui-même."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "Par où commencer"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "A few good first stops on your journey:"
msgstr "Quelques bonnes premières étapes pour votre parcours :"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
msgid "Technical references for prompt engineers and software engineers"
msgstr ""
"Références techniques pour les ingénieurs de prompts et les ingénieurs "
"logiciels"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
msgid "Take a guided tour of the workbench"
msgstr "Faites une visite guidée de l'atelier"

#. Translators: the button that starts the guided tour of the workbench.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
msgid "Tour"
msgstr "Visite"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
msgid "Hide the Console"
msgstr "Masquer la console"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
msgid "Show the Console"
msgstr "Afficher la console"

#. Translators: the tab of the Console about the LLMClient's deployment: its url, and how to use it.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/WorkbenchTour/steps.ts
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "Déploiement"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "Tool Calls"
msgstr "Appels d'outils"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "No tool calls in this chat session yet."
